atham Books","year":"2022"},{"page":7,"title":"Three children running in front of scooters","illustrator":"Siddhi Vartak","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2022"},{"page":8,"title":"Two children running in front of scooters","illustrator":"Siddhi Vartak","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2022"},{"page":9,"title":"Girl playing hide and seek","illustrator":"Siddhi Vartak","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2022"},{"page":10,"title":"A dog barking at two children who are playing","illustrator":"Siddhi Vartak","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2022"},{"page":11,"title":"Girl running through an alley while playing","illustrator":"Siddhi Vartak","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2022"},{"page":12,"title":"Pickle jars on the roof of a home","illustrator":"Siddhi Vartak","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2022"},{"page":13,"title":"A girl sneaking up on her friend","illustrator":"Siddhi Vartak","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2022"},{"page":14,"title":"Children hiding behind a wall","illustrator":"Siddhi Vartak","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2022"},{"page":15,"title":"Children huddled at the end of hide and seek game","illustrator":"Siddhi Vartak","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2022"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-25"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/481241-nammellara-mane/p01.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ನಮ್ಮೆಲ್ಲರ ಮನೆ","ಒಂದರ ಮೇಲೊಂದು ಜೋಡಿಸಿಟ್ಟ ಪೆಟ್ಟಿಗೆಗಳು","ಇವಕ್ಕೆ ಅದೆಷ್ಟು ಕಿಟಕಿ, ಬಾಗಿಲುಗಳು.","ಈ ಬಾಗಿಲುಗಳು ನಮ್ಮ ಕುಟುಂಬಕ್ಕೇ ಸೇರಿವೆ.","ಆದರೆ, ನನ್ನ ಮನೆ ವಿಸ್ತಾರವಾಗಿದೆ.","ನಮ್ಮ ಪುಟ್ಟ ಫ್ಲಾಟ್‌ಗಿಂತ ತುಂಬಾನೇ ದೊಡ್ಡದು."]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/481241-nammellara-mane/p02.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ನಮ್ಮ ಮನೆ","ಬಿಸಿಲಿನಲ್ಲಿ ಪ್ರಕಾಶಮಾನವಾಗಿ ಹೊಳೆದರೆ,"]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/481241-nammellara-mane/p03.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಕೆಲವೊಮ್ಮೆ ಕತ್ತಲೆಯಿಂದ ಮಂಕು ಕವಿದಂತೆ ಕಾಣುತ್ತದೆ."]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/481241-nammellara-mane/p04.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಕೆಲವೊಮ್ಮೆ ಸೆಖೆ ಸೆಖೆ,"]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/481241-nammellara-mane/p05.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಮತ್ತೆ ಕೆಲವು ಸಾರಿ ಥಂಡಿ ಥಂಡಿ."]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/481241-nammellara-mane/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ನನ್ನ ಮನೆ ಹಳದಿ, ಕೆಂಪು, ತಿಳಿಗೆಂಪು ಮಾತ್ರವಲ್ಲ..."]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/481241-nammellara-mane/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಎಲ್ಲ ತರಹದ ಹಸಿರಿನಿಂದಲೂ ಕೂಡಿದೆ."]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/481241-nammellara-mane/p08.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ನನ್ನ ಮನೆ ಅಪರೂಪಕ್ಕೆ ಸದ್ದೇ ಇಲ್ಲದೆ ತಣ್ಣಗಿದ್ದರೆ,"]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/481241-nammellara-mane/p09.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಮತ್ತೆ ಕೆಲವೊಮ್ಮೆ ಗದ್ದಲದ ಗೂಡು.","ನಾಯಿಯ ಬೊಗಳು, ರಿಂಗಣಿಸುವುದು","ಮತ್ತು ಹಾಡುವುದೂ ಕೂಡ!"]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/481241-nammellara-mane/p10.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಅದೋ ಕರಿಯನ ಬೊಗಳು","ಪಕ್ಯಾ ಹಾಗೂ ಬಳಗದ ಕಾವ್ ಕಾವ್","ಮಾಯಾ ಮತ್ತವಳ ಮರಿಗಳ ಮಿಯಾಂವ್ ಮಿಯಾಂವ್ ಗದ್ದಲ ಕೇಳಿದಿರಿ ತಾನೇ?"]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/481241-nammellara-mane/p11.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಅಜ್ಜಿಯ ಉಪ್ಪಿನಕಾಯಿ ಘಮ,","ಅಳಿಲುಗಳ ಕ್ಯುವ್ ಕ್ಯುವ್ ಸದ್ದು","ಮತ್ತು ದೂಳಿನಂತಹ ಮಧ್ಯಾಹ್ನದ ಬಿಸಿಲು-","ಇವೆಲ್ಲವನ್ನು ನನ್ನ ಮನೆ ಆವರಿಸಿದೆ."]},{"n":12,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/481241-nammellara-mane/p12.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ನನ್ನ ಮನೆ ಎಂದರೆ"]},{"n":13,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/481241-nammellara-mane/p13.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಆಸ್ಮಿ, ಫಾಲಕ್, ರೋಷನ್, ಸಾಮಿ, ಜಿಲ್‌ಮಿಲ್ ಸ್ನೇಹಿತರು.","ಹಾಗೂ ಬಹಳಷ್ಟು ಕಿಟಕಿ, ಬಾಗಿಲುಗಳು."]},{"n":14,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/481241-nammellara-mane/p14.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಕಣ್ಣಾಮುಚ್ಚಾಲೆ ಆಟಕ್ಕೆ ನನ್ನ ಮನೆ ಹೇಳಿ ಮಾಡಿಸಿದಂತಿದೆ. ಅಲ್ವಾ!"]}],"wordCount":119}